 not speak today to [any] man.'\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"19:27","t":"Then she brought him to her people, carrying him. They said, \"O Mary, you have certainly done a thing unprecedented.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"19:28","t":"O sister [i.e., descendant] of Aaron, your father was not a man of evil, nor was your mother unchaste.\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"19:29","t":"So she pointed to him. They said, \"How can we speak to one who is in the cradle a child?\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"19:30","t":"[Jesus] said, \"Indeed, I am the servant of Allāh. He has given me the Scripture and made me a prophet.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"19:31","t":"And He has made me blessed wherever I am and has enjoined upon me prayer and zakāh as long as I remain alive","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"19:32","t":"And [made me] dutiful to my mother, and He has not made me a wretched tyrant.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"19:33","t":"And peace is on me the day I was born and the day I will die and the day I am raised alive.\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"19:34","t":"That is Jesus, the son of Mary - the word of truth about which they are in dispute.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"19:35","t":"It is not [befitting] for Allāh to take a son; exalted is He! When He decrees an affair, He only says to it, \"Be,\" and it is.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":35,"sd":null},{"k":"19:36","t":"[Jesus said], \"And indeed, Allāh is my Lord and your Lord, so worship Him. That is a straight path.\"","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":36,"sd":null},{"k":"19:37","t":"Then the factions differed [concerning Jesus] from among them, so woe to those who disbelieved - from the scene of a tremendous Day.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"19:38","t":"How [clearly] they will hear and see the Day they come to Us, but the wrongdoers today are in clear error.","j":16,"h":31,"s":19,"a":38,"sd":null}],"juz":16,"hizb":31,"surahs":[19],"sajdah":false}